        "baseline": 28,
        "latex": "I_{nom}(h)\\coloneq\\frac{b_a t_f^3}{6}+\\frac{b_a t_f\\left(h-t_f\\right)^2}{2}+\\frac{t_w\\left(h-2t_f\\right)^3}{12}+4A_{fil}\\left(\\frac{h}{2}-t_f-0.2234r\\right)^2",
