      "x": 76,
      "y": 9109,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Deck transverse and fixed to the top flange at every rib (c_LT.d = 1; SCI P300 practice): the flange is restrained at the rib pitch, L_LT = e_r. Deck parallel: no restraint.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
