      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 9198,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Singapore NA (and UK NA) §6.3.2.3: rolled I, λ_LT,0 = 0.4, β = 0.75, curves h/b ≤ 2 b, ≤ 3.1 c, else d; welded I, λ_LT,0 = 0.2, β = 1, h/b ≤ 2 c, else d; f with k_c = 1/√C1. Recommended values: §6.3.2.2, Table 6.4 (rolled a / b, welded c / d), λ_LT,0 = 0.2, β = 1, no f. A tapered beam is welded when c_weld = 1.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
