      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 13025,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Deck (§6.6.4): the solid-slab resistance is multiplied by k_l (6.22, ribs parallel) or k_t (6.23, ribs transverse, ≤ k_t,max of Table 6.2 for studs welded through the sheeting, d ≤ 20 mm); f_u ≤ 450 MPa with k_t.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_de",
