    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 437,
      "y": 28867,
      "props": {
        "w": 28,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "<b><i>v</i><sub>f</sub></b>",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#1d4ed8",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 28994,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "a-a: vertical planes through <i>h</i><sub>c</sub> beside the studs;",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#b91c1c",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29010,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "<i>v</i><sub>f</sub> / 2 on each; crossed by top + bottom bars, <i>A</i><sub>t</sub> + <i>A</i><sub>b</sub>",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#111111",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 398,
      "y": 28994,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "b-b: around the studs, length 2<i>h</i><sub>sc</sub> + <i>d</i><sub>head</sub> + <i>b</i><sub>0</sub>;",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#0f766e",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 398,
      "y": 29010,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "the whole <i>v</i><sub>f</sub>; crossed by the bottom bars twice, 2<i>A</i><sub>b</sub>",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#111111",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29034,
      "props": {
        "w": 636,
        "h": 16,
        "html": "Both surfaces run the whole length of the beam; the front face is the cross-section (schematic).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "color": "#64748b",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "groupId": "s_ec4_group_tz"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29056,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Surface lengths and bars counted per EC4 §6.6.6.1(3) and §6.6.6.2(3) (b_0 = 0 for a single stud row); bars anchored past each surface to EN 1992-1-1 §8.4.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29111,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Reinforcement design strength",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vr"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vs",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 29081,
      "props": {
        "w": 184,
        "h": 39,
        "baseline": 23,
        "latex": "f_{sd}\\coloneq \\frac{f_{sk}}{\\gamma_S}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "MPa",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vr"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29135,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Deck (§6.6.6.4, Figure 6.16): h_f on a-a is the concrete above the deck; with transverse ribs and k_t, surface b-b need not be checked; a transverse deck continuous across the beam may count as reinforcement on a-a, (6.25).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29335,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Ribs parallel: b-b runs around the studs down to the flange, as in a solid slab; a wider surface c-c runs around the rib, and there the depth of the deck is not counted (§6.6.6.4(3)).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29360,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "The flow follows the studs provided (§6.6.6.2(1)), but the slab cannot take more than N_c,f over the shorter shear span: studs beyond full connection add no shear.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29385,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Connector flow at the closest spacing, capped at full connection",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vw"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vx",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 29412,
      "props": {
        "w": 405,
        "h": 43,
        "baseline": 26,
        "latex": "v_f\\coloneq \\min\\left(\\frac{n_{re}P_{Rd}}{\\min\\left(s_A,s_B\\right)},\\frac{N_{c.f}}{\\min\\left(x_M,L-x_M\\right)}\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN/m",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vw"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29472,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Deck design strength",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vy"
    },
