        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Figure 6.16: from each edge of the rib at the deck crest, inclined up to the stud head, and across the head. The part beside the deck is not counted. Rib width at the crest taken as b_r (on the short side for an open rib). Crossed by the bars below the stud head twice, 2A_b.",
