        "baseline": 18,
        "latex": "M_s(x,c_G,c_Q)\\coloneq\\mathrm{dot}\\left(c_G g_u+c_Q q_u,k_u(x)\\right)+\\mathrm{dot}\\left(c_G G_P+c_Q Q_P,k_P(x)\\right)",
