      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "ULS combination. Singapore NA (c_NA = 1): (6.10a) γ_G G + γ_Q ψ_0 Q and (6.10b) ξ γ_G G + γ_Q Q on g_0 and every table row; the larger maximum moment governs the moments, the larger end shear the shears. Recommended values (c_NA = 0): (6.10), each row with its own γ_F.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
